The upstream project provides the original album ingestion, SQLite schema,
caption/OCR/aggregation/profile/story/MCP/Web design. The AX8860 adaptation
adds remote OpenAI-compatible model endpoints, board model selection, a
single-concurrency demo pipeline, and the AX8860 web dashboard.

Model weights are not distributed with this repository. Deployed models:

  Qwen3.5-2B                 (see upstream model license)
  MiniCPM-OCR-1.0            (see upstream model license)
  MiniCPM-V-4.7-35B-A3B      (see upstream model license)

Runtime components:

  AXERA Model Manager / llama.cpp / ggml-axera
  (see the corresponding AXERA distribution for licenses)
